<StudioLayout title="DriveDeck \u2014 Your drive, organized like a workspace." description="DriveDeck turns an external SSD into a desktop workspace. Organize files, manage verified transfers, and safely eject. Windows first. Version 1.0 complete; awaiting launch.">
<section class="container drive-hero"><div><a class="text-link" href="/products/">← All tools</a><p class="eyebrow">DRIVEDECK / WINDOWS FIRST</p><h1>Your drive,<br>organized like<br>a workspace.</h1><p class="lede">DriveDeck turns an external SSD into a desktop you can live in—drop files, move things around, clean up—then safely eject.</p><div class="drive-release"><span class="status launch">Version 1.0 complete · Awaiting launch</span><p>Public downloads are not available yet.</p></div><a class="button" href="#features">Explore version 1.0 <span>↓</span></a></div><div class="drive-hero-art"><div class="drive-illustration" aria-hidden="true"><div class="drive-window"><div class="drive-window-bar"><strong>DriveDeck</strong><span>YOUR WORKSPACE, ON YOUR DRIVE</span></div><div class="drive-folders"><div><i></i>Projects</div><div><i></i>Archives</div><div><i></i>Music</div><div><i></i>DJ Sets</div></div><div class="drive-window-bottom"><span>Organize. Transfer. Take it with you.</span><b>↗</b></div></div><span class="image-label">WORKSPACE ILLUSTRATION · WINDOWS FIRST</span></div></div></section>
<div class="discipline-strip"><div class="container"><span>A workspace that travels with your files.</span><p>Organize <b>✳</b> Transfer <b>✳</b> Safely eject</p></div></div>
<section class="section container" id="features"><div class="section-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">WHAT 1.0 DOES</p><h2>Plug in.<br>Make yourself at home.</h2></div><p>From the first connection to the last safe eject, built around working with an external drive.</p></div><div class="drive-features">
<article><span class="card-number">01 / YOUR WORKSPACE</span><h3>A desktop for your drive.</h3><p>DriveDeck detects external drives through native device notifications. Claim a drive and browse a large-icon desktop, with pins for Desktop, Downloads, Projects, Archives, Music, and DJ Sets.</p><p>Switch any folder window to a sortable Details view. A host tray helper can open DriveDeck automatically when your claimed drive is plugged in.</p></article>
<article><span class="card-number">02 / BRING TO DRIVE</span><h3>Transfers you can manage.</h3><p>Queue files, pause or cancel a transfer, and handle conflicts as they come up. Resume after an interrupted session, with optional BLAKE3 verification.</p><p>Import music into a flat folder, an Artist/Album structure, or a new DJ set folder, with audio tags.</p></article>
<article><span class="card-number">03 / FIND & ORGANIZE</span><h3>Keep everything within reach.</h3><p>Quick Look, file properties, thumbnails, and indexed search with filters help you find what you need.</p><p>Undo and redo file operations, with an app-side trash stored on the drive. An activity log keeps the work visible.</p></article>
<article><span class="card-number">04 / READY TO UNPLUG</span><h3>Leave with confidence.</h3><p>Native Safely Eject is gated while copies are running and aware of what is holding the drive open.</p><p>Check drive health through SMART/NVMe reporting and back up pins to a second drive.</p></article>
</div><div class="drive-foundations"><div><h3>Accessible from the start.</h3><p>Full keyboard navigation, screen-reader roles, and first-run coach marks.</p></div><div><h3>Considered delivery.</h3><p>A signed installer with in-app updates. Crash reports are opt-in and scrubbed on-device.</p></div></div></section>
<section class="drive-launch-band"><div class="container"><div><p class="eyebrow">NEXT STOP / LAUNCH</p><h2>Built. Getting ready<br>to meet your drive.</h2><p>DriveDeck 1.0 is complete and awaiting launch. Windows first.</p></div><a class="text-link" href="/products/">Explore the studio’s tools <span>↗</span></a></div></section>
</StudioLayout>
